WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:15.000
1. Begin with the proven version
All live traffic goes to v1. The new version is ready for a limited release.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:30.000
2. Send a small sample to v2
Route an illustrative 5% of traffic to v2. Most requests still go to v1.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:45.000
3. Expand after checking results
If the release looks healthy, increase its share. Pause or roll back if error rates or latency worsen.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:00.000
4. Promote the new version
After the safety checks pass, route all traffic to v2. The canary has become the main version.
